# Mapped the editor palette to ANSI: variable red, string green, attribute
# yellow, function blue, keyword magenta, and system identifier cyan.
# Bright accents repeat the normal colors because upstream has no ANSI palette.
# Neutral colors use plain text, comments, invisibles, and the background.

